    "text": "The study aims to assess healthcare providers' perception and attitude toward using artificial intelligence technology in healthcare settings at Ministry of Health hospitals in Jeddah.",
    "topic": "Healthcare providers' perception of AI in healthcare"
  },
  {
    "text": "The rapid adoption of technology in healthcare has increased the need for healthcare providers and patients to use computer technology.",
    "topic": "Impact of technology adoption in healthcare"
  },
  {
    "text": "The research focuses on a post-pandemic review of the connection between human learning neurocognitive processes and artificial neural networks.",
    "topic": "Post-pandemic neurocognitive processes and AI"
  },
  {
    "text": "The study analyzed the relationship between neurocognitive processes associated with human learning and artificial neural networks in the post-pandemic context.",
    "topic": "Neurocognitive processes and artificial neural networks"
  },
  {
    "text": "The intersection of technological progress and human values is highlighted in the context of Artificial Intelligence in the 21st century.",
    "topic": "Technological progress and human values in AI"
  }
